3241	## 5. How to test on day one
3242	
3243	Without phones (keyboard + bots, the spec's "placeholder loop")
3244	1. `npm test`: `tests/teams.test.ts` (balance table, join/leave moves, spectators, size switch, swap/move, start check, reset), `tests/rules.test.ts` (hit matrix, timeline, docks, water, scoring, feed, minimap, state machine, inventory, crates), `tests/aim.test.ts` (assist, diamond, lock, mortar, crosshair, keyboard dYaw), `tests/layout.test.ts` (rects, overlap, coverage, GL flip). 57 tests, about 0.2 s.
3245	2. `npm run dev`, open `http://localhost:5173/scene`. Press F4 (or 0) four times: four bot teams appear in the lobby in Rosso, Azzurro, Verde, Oro with 3 bot players each; the layout switches 1 -> 2 -> 2x2 as teams are added.
3246	3. Enter: countdown 10 s with beeps at 3-2-1 and the horn; the clock then reads 5:00 and counts down. Press T so the bots drive, loot, shoot, sink and respawn: the kill feed fills, the scoreboard reorders, cells show the kill-cam and "SUNK by X" with a countdown.
3247	4. Press 1, hold W and A/D: Rosso's boat responds while the bots keep the other three busy. Left/Right turns the view, not the boat; the bow arrow at the bottom turns; the diamond appears when an enemy crosses the crosshair and Left/Right feel slower (x 0.6). F5 gives a random weapon; Space fires; the last shot returns the Water Cannon. Q/E use powers; B bails after a bot's water cannon fills the hull (the bar in the bottom right).
3248	5. F6 sinks the focused boat: feed "Rosso sank", 2 s sink, respawn at a dock at least 80 m from the bots, bubble for 3 s that ends as soon as Space is pressed.
3249	6. P pauses: the clock stops, nothing moves, P resumes with no jump. Let the 5:00 run out: results for 20 s (ranking, top Gunner, best ram), then the lobby again with the same teams; Enter rematches.
3250	7. Force a tie: with two bot teams and bots off (T), F5 + Space to score once from each side with identical deaths, let the clock run out: overtime 30 s with "SUDDEN DEATH", the third team's cell shows "ELIMINATED"; score once -> results immediately.
3251	8. Layout check: F4 up to six teams and look at 2 / 3 / 4 / 5 / 6 cells: the minimap sits in the spare cell or at the centre; borders and names in the right colours; F1 (or 7) overlays fps and the per-team state.
3252	
3253	With phones (after Gate 1)
3254	1. `npm run tunnel`, scan the QR with two phones: both appear in the lobby in join order (Pilot, Gunner of Rosso). A third phone becomes Rosso's Engineer; a fourth opens Azzurro and takes Rosso's Engineer with it (2+2): both phones show the new colour and role.
3255	2. On a phone: Swap role with a teammate -> roles flip on the big screen and both phones. Move to the other team -> allowed only when it has a free slot; the bumped player (if any) gets a toast.
3256	3. Lock a phone during the countdown: its name greys out, the boat idles when the battle starts; unlock -> it resumes in the same slot; press 1 and W meanwhile to drive it from the keyboard.
3257	4. Enable controls not tapped on one phone: Start is still allowed; the lobby lists the name in orange.
3258	5. Host switches team size 3 -> 2 with 7 phones: 2+2+2 and one spectator phone showing "you are next"; back to 3: 3+2+2.
3259	6. Play one full round: calibration during the countdown (C on the keyboard for the focused Pilot), 5:00, results, Rematch keeps teams; New lobby re-seats by join order.
